        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to these stores, we sell products on our company-owned e-commerce sites and third-party marketplace sites, our franchisees sell products through sites that they manage as well as other third-party marketplace sites.",
        "start_character": 2499,
        "end_character": 2726
      },
      {
