        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-012501",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since our signature products, teddy bears and other stuffed animals, are included in the toy category, we compete indirectly with a number of companies that sell plush products or premium children’s toys, including, but not limited to, Ty, Jellycat, Jazwares, Hasbro, Pop Mart, Mattel and Lego.",
